This module includes code ported from the Puppet AEM Module (bstopp/aem 3.0.0,
https://github.com/bstopp/puppet-aem), because that module is unmaintained and
incompatible with OpenVox 9:

  manifests/aem_instance.pp                       (aem::instance)
  manifests/aem_package.pp                        (aem::package)
  manifests/aem_service.pp                        (aem::service, aem::service::systemd)
  templates/systemd/aem.service.epp               (templates/etc/init.d/systemd.erb)
  lib/puppet/type/aem_curator_installer.rb        (aem_installer type)
  lib/puppet/provider/aem_curator_installer/default.rb (aem_installer provider)

